### CORRECTION: exact arbitrary-window transfer (THM-1137) ###
  Phi(x) = min(6/7,(x-1/7)/2); Phi(1)=3/7
  sharp window [1/2,3/2] has two maximal safe pieces of length 3/7
  sound coarse recursion threshold: adjacent ratio >= 7/3 (not 7/6)

